    <kabod:contentNotes>Source page advertises 11 parts; the actual sermon list contains 11 entries (covers Hosea 1–14). Original preaching dates are not catalogued by the source — pubDate is set to the start of Still's Aberdeen ministry as a placeholder; ordering follows the source's canonical sequence.</kabod:contentNotes>
